    "display_title": "本保險處方用藥有下列情況者視為重複用藥，不予給付(87/4/1)",
    "full_text_blocks": [
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 0,
        "render_kind": "clause_heading",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.9"
        ],
        "text": "九、本保險處方用藥有下列情況者視為重複用藥，不予給付(87/4/1)："
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 1,
        "render_kind": "subsection",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.9"
        ],
        "text": "（一）為達相同之治療目的，使用兩種以上同一治療類別 (或作用機轉) 之藥品，視為重複用藥。"
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 2,
        "render_kind": "subsection",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.9"
        ],
        "text": "（二）為達相同之治療目的，使用兩種以上不同治療類別 (或作用機轉) 之藥品，而未能增加療效；或其併用不符合一般醫學學理，且無文獻佐證者。"
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 3,
        "render_kind": "subsection",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.9"
        ],
        "text": "（三）但下列情形除外："
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 4,
        "render_kind": "list_item",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.9"
        ],
        "text": "1.長短效的藥品搭配使用或不同劑型配合使用，且其使用方法符合各項藥品藥動學或藥理性質之特色者。"
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 5,
        "render_kind": "list_item",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.9"
        ],
        "text": "2.緊急傷病情況下之合併使用者，且其併用符合一般醫學學理。"
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 6,
        "render_kind": "list_item",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.9"
        ],
        "text": "3.本標準藥品給付規定有特別規定者。"
      }
    ],
    "legal_effective_status": "not_claimed",
